  "facts": [
    "Honaz Tunnel burst onto Turkey’s road network on 28 January 2023, when President Recep Tayyip Erdoğan officially opened the 1,200‑meter passage, cutting travel time across Mount Honaz for commuters and freight alike.",
    "Spanning Mount Honaz, the Honaz Tunnel links the D.585 and D.320 state roads, creating a seamless corridor that bypasses the rugged terrain and streamlines regional commerce.",
    "Constructed beneath Mount Honaz, the Honaz Tunnel’s 1,200‑meter length showcases Turkey’s commitment to modernizing infrastructure, ensuring safer, faster travel for thousands of daily drivers and reduces environmental impact by preserving the mountain’s natural landscape."
